# --- Local development (SQLite file) ---
# No extra config needed — the app creates data/naming.db automatically.
# Run: npm run seed

# --- Vercel / Production (Turso cloud database) ---
# Create a free database at https://turso.tech
# Then set these two variables in your Vercel project settings:
TURSO_DATABASE_URL=libsql://your-db-name.turso.io
TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN=your-auth-token-here
